{
  "registry_name": "elementary-region-registry",
  "registry_version": "region-registry-v1",
  "updated": "2026-09-20",
  "notes": [
    "Single source of truth for first-level administrative region scopes in the nationwide expansion (N0-N4).",
    "bounds are validation envelopes measured from the 2026-03-20 nationwide school standard data, widened by 0.05 degrees. They cover schools only; a scope's own EDA must confirm they also cover its apartments.",
    "school_name_prefix is a MATCHING VARIANT, never an assertion. school_name_prefix_coverage_pct is measured: 대구 96.6% and 서울 93.9% mostly carry it, 부산 1.3% and 울산 4.0% essentially do not, and the provinces never do. Matching must accept both the prefixed and unprefixed form of every label.",
    "legacy_code and aliases exist because 강원도 -> 강원특별자치도 (2023) and 전라북도 -> 전북특별자치도 (2024) renamed the region and changed its legal-dong prefix.",
    "address_prefixes lists the strings that may identify this region from the START of an address. Short aliases such as '광주' are for exact source-field values only: 경기도 광주시 would otherwise be read as 광주광역시.",
    "elementary_school_count_20260320 and education_support_office_count come from the same snapshot. The 17 regions account for all 6,303 nationwide elementary schools with no unresolved address.",
    "merged_source_regions translates source values that do not map one-to-one onto a registry region. Resolve with resolve_source_region(); never add such a value as a plain alias."
  ],
